        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Painted Grey Ware culture</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Homeland</span><span class="info-stat-val">The western Gangetic plain and the Ghaggar-Hakra valley, with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sutlej-river">Sutlej</a> and upper Ganga-<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yamuna">Yamuna</a> valleys (<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/haryana">Haryana</a>, western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/uttar-pradesh">Uttar Pradesh</a>, around <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/delhi">Delhi</a>); key sites <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mathura">Mathura</a>, Ahichhatra, Jakhera, Bhagwanpura, Alamgirpur, Kampil</span></div>
